{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10453","headline":"送田少府贬苍梧 · 高适","name":"送田少府贬苍梧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沈吟对迁客，惆怅西南天。\n昔爲一官未得意，今向万里令人怜。\n念兹斗酒成暌间，停舟叹君日将晏。\n远树应怜北地春，行人却羡南归雁。\n丈夫穷达未可知，看君不合长数奇。\n江山到处堪乘兴，杨柳青青那足悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10453.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10453","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}